        editorPosition: {x: 900, y: 380}
        speakerId: Glow
        text: "Wait\u2026 do you see how everything changes here?"
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530179
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row9_0081a492
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row10_c088bfa7
        editorPosition: {x: 1200, y: 380}
        speakerId: Glow
        text: Some corners of the World-Tree have lost their colors. Around here,
          people call it the Monochronite.
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530180
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row10_c088bfa7
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row11_f0765fae
        editorPosition: {x: 1500, y: 380}
        speakerId: Glow
        text: "Sometimes, when things get heavy \u2014 stress, fear, loneliness \u2014
          the World-Tree loses a bit of its light. But \u201Cfaded\u201D doesn\u2019t
          mean \u201Clost.\u201D There\u2019s always color, just underneath."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530181
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row11_f0765fae
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row12_2c1b82b0
        editorPosition: {x: 1800, y: 380}
        speakerId: Player
        text: The World-Tree?
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530182
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row12_2c1b82b0
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row13_bc5ea949
        editorPosition: {x: 2100, y: 380}
        speakerId: Glow
        text: "Yep. You\u2019re standing on it right now. Its sap \u2014 the sap
          of hope \u2014 feeds everything that grows in this world."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530183
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row13_bc5ea949
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row14_3fd417f9
        editorPosition: {x: 2400, y: 380}
        speakerId: Glow
        text: And together, we can help bring some color back. One small step at
          a time. See those unlit lights, right next to us? Bring me close to them.
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530184
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row14_3fd417f9
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row15_f04b3010
        editorPosition: {x: 2700, y: 380}
        speakerId: Glow
        text: "It worked! The World-Tree\u2019s colors are coming back. It\u2019s
          a small step, but small steps change more than we think."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530185
      type: {class: EndNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row15_f04b3010
        choices: []
        editorPosition: {x: 3000, y: 380}
        outcomeId: neutral
    - rid: 3506134116684530186
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.3.1 a) i
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row17_db413840
        editorPosition: {x: 3300, y: 380}
        speakerId: Justine
        text: "Their Jemytos are eating our fruit! This can\u2019t go on. They pour
          into our forest, and we just let it happen?! Come on, everyone to the Ytorale
          village \u2014 we\u2019ll tell them to their faces!"
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530187
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row17_db413840
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row18_1754d232
        editorPosition: {x: 3600, y: 380}
        speakerId: Protesting Phytos
        text: The Jemytos peck while the Ytorales sleep!
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530188
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row18_1754d232
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row19_b5e4c32b
        editorPosition: {x: 3900, y: 380}
        speakerId: Player
        text: Justine, wait. Storming over there shouting will just make things worse.
          What if we thought it through first, together?
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530189
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row19_b5e4c32b
        choices:
        - choiceText: suggest a meeting
          nextNodeId: G 1.3.1 a) i _c1
        - choiceText: point out the effect of an aggressive protest
          nextNodeId: G 1.3.1 a) i _c2
        - choiceText: suggest looking before judging
          nextNodeId: G 1.3.1 a) i _c3
        editorPosition: {x: 4200, y: 380}
        speakerId: Justine
        text: "Think it through? We\u2019ve waited long enough. The Ytorales make
          no effort to understand us."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 1
    - rid: 3506134116684530190
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.3.1 a) i _c1
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row21_34efea84
        editorPosition: {x: 4500, y: 380}
        speakerId: Player
        text: What if we set up a real meeting with them, to talk it out directly?
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530191
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row21_34efea84
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: G 1.3.1 a) i _cont
        editorPosition: {x: 4800, y: 380}
        speakerId: Justine
        text: "A meeting? Last time they just said \u201Cyeah, yeah\u201D\u2026 But
          okay. Maybe."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530192
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.3.1 a) i _c2
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row23_cbe1986f
        editorPosition: {x: 5100, y: 380}
        speakerId: Player
        text: "If you show up over there yelling, you\u2019re the ones who\u2019ll
          look like the troublemakers, not them."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530193
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row23_cbe1986f
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: G 1.3.1 a) i _cont
        editorPosition: {x: 5400, y: 380}
        speakerId: Justine
        text: "Hmm. You might be right. But we can\u2019t just sit on our hands either."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530194
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.3.1 a) i _c3
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row25_0ab2e500
        editorPosition: {x: 5700, y: 380}
        speakerId: Player
        text: "What if we just started by seeing what\u2019s actually going on over
          there?"
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530195
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row25_0ab2e500
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row26_5f980d21
        editorPosition: {x: 6000, y: 380}
        speakerId: Justine
        text: "True\u2026 Maybe we\u2019re reacting too fast. Honestly, none of us
          has ever set foot in the Ytorale village."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530196
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row26_5f980d21
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: G 1.3.1 a) i _cont
        editorPosition: {x: 6300, y: 380}
        speakerId: Justine
        text: Okay. Tom, go to the Ytorale village and see how things really are.
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530197
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.3.1 a) i _cont
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row28_69aaccef
        editorPosition: {x: 6600, y: 380}
        speakerId: Glow
        text: "You did well to step in. Observe, understand, then act: that\u2019s
          often how you defuse a conflict. You showed them the answer wasn\u2019t
          in confrontation, but in talking."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
