        editorPosition: {x: 39300, y: 380}
        speakerId: Tom
        text: "What\u2019s the point? He doesn\u2019t even listen to me."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530307
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.5.5 c) i _c2
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row138_67cddc85
        editorPosition: {x: 39600, y: 380}
        speakerId: Player
        text: What do you expect from them, deep down?
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530308
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row138_67cddc85
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: G 1.5.5 c) i _cont
        editorPosition: {x: 39900, y: 380}
        speakerId: Tom
        text: "To take charge of their Jemytos! They eat all the fruit in our forest.
          It\u2019s their people, their responsibility."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530309
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.5.5 c) i _c3
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row140_1a633796
        editorPosition: {x: 40200, y: 380}
        speakerId: Player
        text: What if we found a way to share the fruit fairly?
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530310
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row140_1a633796
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: G 1.5.5 c) i _cont
        editorPosition: {x: 40500, y: 380}
        speakerId: Tom
        text: "You think it\u2019s that simple? They\u2019d have to grow their own
          fruit first\u2026 Easier said than done."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530311
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.5.5 c) i _cont
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row142_d0e71ae2
        editorPosition: {x: 40800, y: 380}
        speakerId: Glow
        text: "Tom\u2019s stuck in his anger, but he\u2019s looking for a way out.
          Go take a look at the Phyto forest: you\u2019ll understand the fruit and
          the Jemytos better. Sometimes you have to go back to the source."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530312
      type: {class: ActionNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row142_d0e71ae2
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row143_f947c2d5
        editorPosition: {x: 41100, y: 380}
        actionType: 0
        actionFlagName: SpeaksTom
        actionFlagValue: 1
        actionScriptId: 
    - rid: 3506134116684530313
      type: {class: EndNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row143_f947c2d5
        choices: []
        editorPosition: {x: 41400, y: 380}
        outcomeId: quest_complete
    - rid: 3506134116684530314
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.5.5 c) ii
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row145_d62aec5e
        editorPosition: {x: 41700, y: 380}
        speakerId: Player
        text: "Harry, you seem worn out\u2026 Want to tell me what\u2019s wrong?"
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530315
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row145_d62aec5e
        choices:
        - choiceText: ask what the Phytos could do
          nextNodeId: G 1.5.5 c) ii _c1
        - choiceText: suggest a meeting
          nextNodeId: G 1.5.5 c) ii _c2
        - choiceText: ask about the incinerator
          nextNodeId: G 1.5.5 c) ii _c3
        editorPosition: {x: 42000, y: 380}
        speakerId: Harry
        text: "I\u2019ll never understand why the Phytos refuse to cooperate. We
          already do so much for them with the incinerator! Without us, the portal
          wouldn\u2019t even run."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 1
    - rid: 3506134116684530316
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.5.5 c) ii _c1
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row147_f5c626c8
        editorPosition: {x: 42300, y: 380}
        speakerId: Player
        text: What could the Phytos do to help you?
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530317
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row147_f5c626c8
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: G 1.5.5 c) ii _cont
        editorPosition: {x: 42600, y: 380}
        speakerId: Harry
        text: Recognize our efforts, at least! We produce energy for everyone, and
          they only see their own problems.
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530318
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.5.5 c) ii _c2
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row149_7b9a190e
        editorPosition: {x: 42900, y: 380}
        speakerId: Player
        text: What if we set up a real meeting to talk it over?
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530319
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row149_7b9a190e
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: G 1.5.5 c) ii _cont
        editorPosition: {x: 43200, y: 380}
        speakerId: Harry
        text: "A meeting? Last time, Tom laid out his problem and left. I get the
          feeling they don\u2019t want to hear about cooperation."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530320
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.5.5 c) ii _c3
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row151_5a31debe
        editorPosition: {x: 43500, y: 380}
        speakerId: Player
        text: Can you tell me more about the incinerator and what it does?
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530321
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: row151_5a31debe
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: G 1.5.5 c) ii _cont
        editorPosition: {x: 43800, y: 380}
        speakerId: Harry
        text: "It powers the Reincarnation Portal. Without it, no Jemytos \u2014
          for us or for them. But the Phytos forget that a little too easily."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
    - rid: 3506134116684530322
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay.NewDialogue, asm: GlimmerOfHope.Gameplay}
      data:
        nodeId: G 1.5.5 c) ii _cont
        choices:
        - choiceText: 
          nextNodeId: row153_d8ed6cbb
        editorPosition: {x: 44100, y: 380}
        speakerId: Glow
        text: "Harry feels misunderstood. To get the whole story, go see the incinerator
          for yourself: you\u2019ll understand how it matters to everyone."
        bubblePrefab: {fileID: 0}
        followSpeaker: 0
        bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2, z: 0}
        useTypewriter: 0
        typewriterCharsPerSecond: 30
        hasChoices: 0
